OL,3,GNEWSAPlan for 'visually intrusive'
OL,4,Aphone mast blocked
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe installation of a "visually
OL,7,Fintrusive" mobile phone mast near
OL,8,Fcommunity sports facilities has been
OL,9,Fblocked by a council.
OL,11,FTelecoms firm Cornerstone sought
OL,12,Fpermission from Leeds City Council to
OL,13,Ffit a 25m (82ft) mast at Gipton's
OL,14,FFearnville Leisure Centre and playing
OL,15,Ffields.
OL,17,FThe company said the mast was needed to
OL,18,Freplace an existing installation on top
OL,19,Fof nearby Oak Tree House and warned of
OL,20,Fa loss of 5G coverage.
OL,23,APub: 18-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,390,380,200,160,0,100
