OL,3,GNEWSAPlan for 'visually intrusive'
OL,4,Aphone mast blocked
OL,5,
OL,6,FCouncil planners raised concerns about
OL,7,Fthe height and visual impact of the
OL,8,Fproposed mast on recreational land and
OL,9,Fsaid it would "result in an incongruous
OL,10,Fand unduly prominent feature which
OL,11,Fwould adversely affect the character
OL,12,Fand visual amenity of the surrounding
OL,13,Farea."
OL,23,APub: 18-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
